          "date": "2026-09-25",
          "publisher": "SMART Health IT (connectathon example)",
          "description": "Example physician-authored follow-up form for a patient about 4 weeks after starting weekly semaglutide. Asks only what the patient's record can't answer: how the shots are going, side effects, red-flag symptoms, and readiness to step up the dose. Synthetic example for the KTC SMART Health Check-in connectathon; not clinical guidance.",
          "item": [
            {
              "linkId": "intro",
